    "description": "酒店版行业差异资产包：7 个数字员工预设 + 基线围栏包 + 对象/阶段枚举 + 一店一档数据结构 + 官方技能（需求文档 V2.5 §2.2/§2.3）",
    "status": "candidate",
    "owner": "WorkLoom 酒店产品组",
    "example": true,
    "compatibility": {
      "base": ">=0.1.0 <1.0.0",
      "ui": ">=0.1.0 <1.0.0",
      "contract": "2.0.0"
    },
    "provides": {
      "presets": [
        "presets/pricing-agent.yml",
        "presets/review-agent.yml",
        "presets/reconcile-agent.yml",
        "presets/inspection-agent.yml",
        "presets/content-agent.yml",
        "presets/competitor-agent.yml",
        "presets/desktop-agent.yml"
      ],
      "fences": [
        "fences/hotel-baseline.yml"
      ],
      "skills": [
        "skills/revenue-manager/SKILL.md",
        "skills/review-crisis/SKILL.md",
        "skills/channel-reconciler/SKILL.md"
      ],
      "schemas": [
        "schemas/objects.json",
        "schemas/stages.json",
        "schemas/archive.schema.json"
      ],
      "ui": [
        "ui/cases.json"
      ],
      "floorScene": "floor-scene.json",
      "modelPolicy": "model-policy.yml",
      "feedbackEnums": "feedback-enums.yml",
      "evalQuestions": "eval/questions.json",
      "serviceFront": [
        "service-front/faq.json",
        "service-front/delivery-catalog.json",
        "service-front/repair-catalog.json"
      ]
    },
    "ui": {
      "schemaVersion": "workloom.bundle.ui/v1",
      "terminology": {
        "businessObject": "门店经营事项",
        "customer": "住客",
        "operation": "门店经营",
        "action.price.adjust": "调整房价",
        "action.price.query": "查询房价",
        "action.comment.reply": "回复评论",
        "action.order.reconcile": "订单对账",
        "action.order.refund": "订单退款",
        "action.review.reply": "回复评价",
        "field.occ": "入住率",
        "field.revpar": "每间可售房收入",
        "field.adr": "平均房价"
      },
      "navigation": {
        "slots": []
      },
      "home": {
        "widgets": [
          {
            "slot": "home.quick-tasks",
            "component": "QuickTaskList",
            "clients": [
              "pc",
              "b-mobile"
            ],
            "props": {
              "tasks": [
                "盘点今日订单",
                "查看房态异常",
                "处理住客诉求",
                "复盘今日房价"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "welcome": {
        "system": [
          "这是一套为住宿经营打造的智能经营系统，七位数字员工全天候在岗。日常最操心的几件事，它们各司其职：",
          "房价不踏空——持续关注房态和市场价格，在预先设定的规则里给出调整建议；",
          "差评不过夜——各渠道的新评价有人值守，出现问题会带着处理建议请您确认；",
          "对账不熬夜——订单流水逐笔核对，大额退款和异常订单一定请您过目；",
          "淡季不缺内容——持续准备宣传内容，让门店在各渠道保持活跃。",
          "新渠道第一次改价和第一次发布，都必须由您确认。"
        ],
        "keywords": [
          "房价持续关注",
          "评价及时处理",
          "账目自动核对",
          "内容持续更新"
        ]
      },
      "objects": [
        "住客诉求",
        "客房任务",
        "房价策略",
        "渠道账单"
      ],
      "workflows": [
        "住客服务",
        "客房协同",
        "收益管理",
        "渠道对账"
      ],
      "serviceFront": {
        "enabled": true,
        "identityPolicy": "order-proof",
        "adapterId": "hotel.service-front-v1",
        "tabs": [
          "对话",
          "服务",
          "工单",
          "消息",
          "我的"
        ],
        "services": [
          "客需服务",
          "报修",
          "查询工单"
        ]
      },
      "inspection": {
        "enabled": true,
        "adapterId": "hotel.inspection-v1"
      },
      "theme": {
        "brand": {}
      },
      "permissions": [],
      "experiments": []
    }
